  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 5513,
      "text": "For he reflected and plotted [against the Qur’an][6].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 576,
      "ruku": 510,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5514,
      "text": "May he perish, how he plotted!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 576,
      "ruku": 510,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5515,
      "text": "Again, may he perish, how he plotted!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 20,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 576,
      "ruku": 510,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5516,
      "text": "Then he looked around,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 21,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 576,
      "ruku": 510,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5517,
      "text": "then he frowned and scowled,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 22,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 576,
      "ruku": 510,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5518,
      "text": "then turned away with arrogance,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 23,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 576,
      "ruku": 510,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5519,
      "text": "then said, “This is nothing but magic from the past.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 24,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 576,
      "ruku": 510,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5520,
      "text": "This is nothing but the words of a man.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 25,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 576,
      "ruku": 510,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5521,
      "text": "Soon I will make him burn in the Scorching Fire[7].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 26,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 576,
      "ruku": 510,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5522,
      "text": "How do you know what Scorching Fire is?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 27,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 576,
      "ruku": 510,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5523,
      "text": "It leaves nothing and spares no one,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 28,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 576,
      "ruku": 510,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5524,
      "text": "scorching the skin.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 29,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 576,
      "ruku": 510,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5525,
      "text": "It is overseen by nineteen [angels].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 30,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 576,
      "ruku": 510,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5526,
      "text": "We have only appointed angels as keepers of the Fire, and We have only made their number as a test for the disbelievers[8], so that those who were given the Scripture may have certainty and the believers may increase in faith; and neither those who were given the Scripture nor the believers may have any doubts; and so that those [hypocrites] in whose hearts is sickness and the disbelievers may say, “What does Allah mean by this number?” Thus Allah causes to stray whom He wills and guides whom He wills, and none knows the soldiers of your Lord but He. This is but a reminder to mankind.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 31,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 576,
      "ruku": 510,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5527,
      "text": "No indeed! By the moon,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 32,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 576,
      "ruku": 511,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5528,
      "text": "and by the night when it departs,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 33,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 576,
      "ruku": 511,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5529,
      "text": "and by the dawn when it brightens,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 34,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 576,
      "ruku": 511,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5530,
      "text": "Hellfire is indeed one of the greatest matters,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 35,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 576,
      "ruku": 511,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5531,
      "text": "a warning to mankind,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 36,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 576,
      "ruku": 511,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5532,
      "text": "to whoever among you chooses to advance or regress.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 37,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 576,
      "ruku": 511,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5533,
      "text": "Every soul is held in pledge[9] for its deeds,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 38,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 576,
      "ruku": 511,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5534,
      "text": "except the People of the Right[10],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 39,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 576,
      "ruku": 511,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5535,
      "text": "who will be in gardens, asking one another",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 40,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 576,
      "ruku": 511,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5536,
      "text": "about the wicked:",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 41,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 576,
      "ruku": 511,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5537,
      "text": "“What brought you to Hell?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 42,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 576,
      "ruku": 511,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5538,
      "text": "They will say, “We were not among those who prayed,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 43,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 576,
      "ruku": 511,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5539,
      "text": "nor did we feed the poor,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 44,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 576,
      "ruku": 511,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5540,
      "text": "and we indulged in falsehood along with those who indulged in it,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 45,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 576,
      "ruku": 511,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5541,
      "text": "and we denied the Day of Judgment,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 46,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 576,
      "ruku": 511,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5542,
      "text": "until the certainty [of death] came to us.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 47,
